<title>UK: Quebecor Printing sets $150 mln 30-year bond.</title>
<headline>Quebecor Printing sets $150 mln 30-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quebecor Printing Inc has launched a $150 million 30-year bond at a 47 basis points yield spread over U.S. Treasuries, lead manager Salomon Brothers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 6.50 percent notes were reoffered at the 99.728 percent issue price.l</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
